---
description: GymClassBooker project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root: it is the single source of
truth for layout, commands, test-first workflow, `Deps` dependency injection,
the contract test, and the hard security rules (no secrets or vendor values in
the repo, constant-time webhook secret check, least-privilege IAM).

Run `python -m pytest` after every change. Commit messages are one lowercase
line (`feat: ...`, `fix: ...`).
